(295230, 20950, 6202, '<td valign="top">Not sure how well I like this.  The yellow on the flag can be interupted 2 different ways.  It is however a very good image of the flag its just the yellow, although I can''t say to much cause I thought about doing the same thing but didn''t cause of the 2 meanings right now.  Good luck and hope you don''t get to many negative comments cause of being a US flag.  Technically speaking it is good!  Well worth a 7.</td>', 'Not sure how well I like this.  The yellow on the flag can be interupted 2 different ways.  It is however a very good image of the flag its just the yellow, although I can''t say to much cause I thought about doing the same thing but didn''t cause of the 2 meanings right now.  Good luck and hope you don''t get to many negative comments cause of being a US flag.  Technically speaking it is good!  Well worth a 7.', '2003-05-12 03:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
