(296940, 21089, 4493, '<td valign="top">Saturation may be a little high, but I love the feel of this shot. The composition and simplicity really make for a pleasing viewing experience. 10 -danny</td>', 'Saturation may be a little high, but I love the feel of this shot. The composition and simplicity really make for a pleasing viewing experience. 10 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(296941, 20998, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perfect! There is something to be said to paying attention to details! You have mastered this technique! Good job! 10 -danny</td>', 'Perfect! There is something to be said to paying attention to details! You have mastered this technique! Good job! 10 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(296945, 21004, 4493, '<td valign="top">Although we have had many flower shot recently, this one stands out nicely. It meets the challenge very well and I love the soft tones throughout. 9 -danny</td>', 'Although we have had many flower shot recently, this one stands out nicely. It meets the challenge very well and I love the soft tones throughout. 9 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(296947, 20948, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little dark, but the overall abstract nature of this shot is pleasing. I like how the bowls to meet the corners of the frame. 9 -danny</td>', 'Perhaps a little dark, but the overall abstract nature of this shot is pleasing. I like how the bowls to meet the corners of the frame. 9 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(296951, 21069, 4493, '<td valign="top">Simple, silly and goofy, but it works for me! Your colors may not be true blue, yellow and red, but what the heck! I do think that you may have wanted to meter on the bright reflections to minimize your hot spots. 9 -danny</td>', 'Simple, silly and goofy, but it works for me! Your colors may not be true blue, yellow and red, but what the heck! I do think that you may have wanted to meter on the bright reflections to minimize your hot spots. 9 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(296954, 21170, 5112, '<td valign="top">Good entry.  I like it that the dots on the yellow dice are black while those on the blue and red dice are white.  Score = 10</td>', 'Good entry.  I like it that the dots on the yellow dice are black while those on the blue and red dice are white.  Score = 10', '2003-05-13 16:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(296955, 20890, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I wish the little girl''s face were a bit brighter, but this one gets a 10 from me anyway.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I wish the little girl''s face were a bit brighter, but this one gets a 10 from me anyway.', '2003-05-13 16:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(296956, 21099, 4493, '<td valign="top">The clarity and lighting in this shot are fabulous. It''s crisp yet soft and intimate feeling. I would like to see a little space between the red cork and the border, but can see that you wanted it touching so as to balance the corkscrew being off the frame. Good gradients and saturation throughout. Very well done! 9 -danny</td>', 'The clarity and lighting in this shot are fabulous. It''s crisp yet soft and intimate feeling. I would like to see a little space between the red cork and the border, but can see that you wanted it touching so as to balance the corkscrew being off the frame. Good gradients and saturation throughout. Very well done! 9 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(296958, 21085, 5112, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, in particular how the hair colours are matched to the shirt colours.  Score = 10</td>', 'Lovely photo, in particular how the hair colours are matched to the shirt colours.  Score = 10', '2003-05-13 16:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(296963, 20890, 4493, '<td valign="top">Precious shot! Only thing I would change is a tighter crop on the right side so that the girl isn''t in the dead center of the frame. Other then that, excellent work! 9 -danny</td>', 'Precious shot! Only thing I would change is a tighter crop on the right side so that the girl isn''t in the dead center of the frame. Other then that, excellent work! 9 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(296970, 20986, 4493, '<td valign="top">This has a familiar feel to it. :-)<br/> <br/>I like your composition and colors. They make this a strong shot. I also like that the blue and red rope have the other colors innertwined. Good work! 8 -danny</td>', 'This has a familiar feel to it. :-) I like your composition and colors. They make this a strong shot. I also like that the blue and red rope have the other colors innertwined. Good work! 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(296978, 21142, 4493, '<td valign="top">The tape holding them together is slightly distracting, but the overall lighting and mood presented works well. The color saturations and tone are soft and natural. 8 -danny</td>', 'The tape holding them together is slightly distracting, but the overall lighting and mood presented works well. The color saturations and tone are soft and natural. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(296984, 20962, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent flora! The combination of lighting from front and back make for a pleasing warm shot. I like how the tips of the inside part seem to sparkle. Your composition is good and the abstract in the blue adds interest. 8 -danny</td>', 'Excellent flora! The combination of lighting from front and back make for a pleasing warm shot. I like how the tips of the inside part seem to sparkle. Your composition is good and the abstract in the blue adds interest. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(296993, 21088, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and presentation of the flags. The blue sky with the clouds makes for a nice backdrop. I would like to see you boost the saturation a little, but be mindful of possible noise it may introduce. 8 -danny</td>', 'I like the composition and presentation of the flags. The blue sky with the clouds makes for a nice backdrop. I would like to see you boost the saturation a little, but be mindful of possible noise it may introduce. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(296999, 21182, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice clear colorful picture. I''m sure I''m not the first to say it, but I''d prefer the stem pointing at the yellow top. As it is now, it draws my eye out of the frame instead if inward towards the other pepper. Your colors and saturation is well done. 8 -danny</td>', 'Nice clear colorful picture. I''m sure I''m not the first to say it, but I''d prefer the stem pointing at the yellow top. As it is now, it draws my eye out of the frame instead if inward towards the other pepper. Your colors and saturation is well done. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(297005, 21181, 8563, '<td valign="top">Beautiful yellow</td>', 'Beautiful yellow', '2003-05-13 16:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(297009, 21143, 4493, '<td valign="top">Your composition and layout are nice. The colors on the black work to make a powerful impact on the viewer. I would like to see the saturation turned down a little. It''s almost to much as the blue looks too hot. Nice shot. 8 -danny</td>', 'Your composition and layout are nice. The colors on the black work to make a powerful impact on the viewer. I would like to see the saturation turned down a little. It''s almost to much as the blue looks too hot. Nice shot. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(297019, 21127, 4493, '<td valign="top">So well done in lighting that you can''t make these out as balloons. I also feel that this challenge needed representation of all 3 primary colors. The saturation and lighting are perfect! I like your abstract approach as well. Nice shot! 8 -danny</td>', 'So well done in lighting that you can''t make these out as balloons. I also feel that this challenge needed representation of all 3 primary colors. The saturation and lighting are perfect! I like your abstract approach as well. Nice shot! 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(297022, 21200, 4493, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract! The light on the strawberry is a little dark, but concidering the technical challenge for this shot, it''s well done regardless. The white on the lower left seems to unbalance the composition for me. Nicely done. 8 -danny</td>', 'Interesting abstract! The light on the strawberry is a little dark, but concidering the technical challenge for this shot, it''s well done regardless. The white on the lower left seems to unbalance the composition for me. Nicely done. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(297031, 21115, 4493, '<td valign="top">I must say, this is very interesting to look at. Your presentation is very nice. The lighting may need to be diffused some and some of the negative space in the top of the frame could be cropped out, but other then those two items, you have a nice shot that would make a good print. 8 -danny</td>', 'I must say, this is very interesting to look at. Your presentation is very nice. The lighting may need to be diffused some and some of the negative space in the top of the frame could be cropped out, but other then those two items, you have a nice shot that would make a good print. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(297036, 21212, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better paint pics. The lighting is well done to minimize reflections. The yellow seems hot to me, perhaps tuning down the saturation for yellow might lessen that. The composition is cool the way the paints flow together in that pattern. Good pic. 8 -danny</td>', 'This is one of the better paint pics. The lighting is well done to minimize reflections. The yellow seems hot to me, perhaps tuning down the saturation for yellow might lessen that. The composition is cool the way the paints flow together in that pattern. Good pic. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(297037, 21103, 4517, '<td valign="top">Unuasual view point gets you lots of bonus points. 9</td>', 'Unuasual view point gets you lots of bonus points. 9', '2003-05-13 16:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(297039, 21101, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very good flora shot. I would like to see some blue in this shot, but since there isn''t, I will just have to admire the clarity and composition of what is presented. The use of shallow DOF makes the shot more interesting to look at. The time of day the shot was taken helps create a nice soft even lighting on these flowers. Well done. 8 -danny</td>', 'Very good flora shot. I would like to see some blue in this shot, but since there isn''t, I will just have to admire the clarity and composition of what is presented. The use of shallow DOF makes the shot more interesting to look at. The time of day the shot was taken helps create a nice soft even lighting on these flowers. Well done. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(297043, 20997, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very well done abstract. I like the use of shadows and tones throughout. Your focus may be a little soft on the yellow bars, and the crop could stand to be tighter on the right to mimic the black space on the left. I have no idea what this is, but you made a very nice presentation out of it. 8 -danny</td>', 'Very well done abstract. I like the use of shadows and tones throughout. Your focus may be a little soft on the yellow bars, and the crop could stand to be tighter on the right to mimic the black space on the left. I have no idea what this is, but you made a very nice presentation out of it. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(297046, 21121, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the use of colors and shadows in this abstract. The presentation is simple and I feel the angle of the pipes makes for a strong picture. Well done. 8 -danny</td>', 'I like the use of colors and shadows in this abstract. The presentation is simple and I feel the angle of the pipes makes for a strong picture. Well done. 8 -danny', '2003-05-13 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
