(297310, 21221, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the simple concept of this shot. I do feel that a tighter crop and the light being angled differently or bounced off a near by object would help with the hot spot on the package. The ribbon is a nice touch and adds a human touch to it. The package being turned so that the  folded side is less visible would also put a more polished feel to it. 7 -danny</td>', 'I like the simple concept of this shot. I do feel that a tighter crop and the light being angled differently or bounced off a near by object would help with the hot spot on the package. The ribbon is a nice touch and adds a human touch to it. The package being turned so that the  folded side is less visible would also put a more polished feel to it. 7 -danny', '2003-05-13 23:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(297311, 21185, 4493, '<td valign="top">Simple, high key used effectively. I would like to have seen the other primary colors included. The leading line from the lipstick on the paper to the lipstick works nicely. 7 -danny</td>', 'Simple, high key used effectively. I would like to have seen the other primary colors included. The leading line from the lipstick on the paper to the lipstick works nicely. 7 -danny', '2003-05-13 23:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(297313, 21146, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp shot. The use of lighting is very effective in setting the mood. GOD I hate laundry! The perspective seems to be going down hill to the left to me. Perhaps a different angle would have lessened it. Good work. 7 -danny</td>', 'Nice crisp shot. The use of lighting is very effective in setting the mood. GOD I hate laundry! The perspective seems to be going down hill to the left to me. Perhaps a different angle would have lessened it. Good work. 7 -danny', '2003-05-13 23:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(297314, 21217, 4493, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract! The saturation of the yellow then the bursts of red and blue make a wonderful pattern. Did you try flipping the picture so the blue was on the left side of the frame? I wonder how that would change the feel of the shot? Would it make it calmer or more turbulant? Good effective picture. 7 -danny</td>', 'Wonderful abstract! The saturation of the yellow then the bursts of red and blue make a wonderful pattern. Did you try flipping the picture so the blue was on the left side of the frame? I wonder how that would change the feel of the shot? Would it make it calmer or more turbulant? Good effective picture. 7 -danny', '2003-05-13 23:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(297318, 21103, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept. I''d like to see a reshoot where a fill flash is used from below and the lighting above is lower in the sky. I think that the symmetry presented here is strong. 7 -danny</td>', 'This is a great concept. I''d like to see a reshoot where a fill flash is used from below and the lighting above is lower in the sky. I think that the symmetry presented here is strong. 7 -danny', '2003-05-13 23:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(297324, 21146, 2333, '<td valign="top">The lighting is fantastic. I love the comp as well. the dark shadow at upper left is a very slight distraction. <br/>I wold have loved a very bright yellow item, and wish you had shown a little more of the red. Perhaps one of the items hanging over the edge?</td>', 'The lighting is fantastic. I love the comp as well. the dark shadow at upper left is a very slight distraction. I wold have loved a very bright yellow item, and wish you had shown a little more of the red. Perhaps one of the items hanging over the edge?', '2003-05-13 23:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
