(298342, 20769, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great perspective....that sets it apart.. Good job!</td>', 'Great perspective....that sets it apart.. Good job!', '2003-05-14 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(298343, 20998, 1280, '<td valign="top">Whew!  This is perfect!  Really great job.  I wouldn''t change a thing ''cuz this is flawless.  I bet you''ll win a ribbon. 10</td>', 'Whew!  This is perfect!  Really great job.  I wouldn''t change a thing ''cuz this is flawless.  I bet you''ll win a ribbon. 10', '2003-05-14 18:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(298344, 21052, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job!</td>', 'Good job!', '2003-05-14 18:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(298416, 21053, 8726, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.  Great perspective.</td>', 'This is a great picture.  Great perspective.', '2003-05-14 21:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(298432, 21181, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  Score = 9<br/>Changed score to 10, I really like this picture!</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  Score = 9Changed score to 10, I really like this picture!', '2003-05-14 22:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(298522, 21220, 6325, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. Colors, while saturated, are somehow dull. I think the levels are set too narrowly trying to get the black background.</td>', 'Neat idea. Colors, while saturated, are somehow dull. I think the levels are set too narrowly trying to get the black background.', '2003-05-14 23:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(298525, 21149, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The reds are a bit off. Maybe check white balance.</td>', 'Nice composition. The reds are a bit off. Maybe check white balance.', '2003-05-14 23:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(298535, 21086, 6325, '<td valign="top">Kids do have primary colored stuff. The white balance seems off as the reds are orangy.</td>', 'Kids do have primary colored stuff. The white balance seems off as the reds are orangy.', '2003-05-14 23:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(298551, 20997, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the out of focus blue and red. Wish the yellows were more saturated.</td>', 'I like the out of focus blue and red. Wish the yellows were more saturated.', '2003-05-14 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(298589, 21085, 6325, '<td valign="top">Very nice. One of the few that did red correctly. I like the different color hair matched with the shirts.</td>', 'Very nice. One of the few that did red correctly. I like the different color hair matched with the shirts.', '2003-05-15 00:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(298591, 21126, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well done. Colors are right on. Good balance of candid vs posed. The promary colors seem just right for a child.</td>', 'Well done. Colors are right on. Good balance of candid vs posed. The promary colors seem just right for a child.', '2003-05-15 00:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(298595, 21089, 6325, '<td valign="top">Neat. Has a surreal effect. Focus could be a tad sharper on the yellow butterfly.</td>', 'Neat. Has a surreal effect. Focus could be a tad sharper on the yellow butterfly.', '2003-05-15 00:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(298597, 21213, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the layout. Maybe crank the exposure down a stop.</td>', 'I like the layout. Maybe crank the exposure down a stop.', '2003-05-15 00:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(298603, 21208, 6325, '<td valign="top">Best of the playground shots.</td>', 'Best of the playground shots.', '2003-05-15 00:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(298679, 21136, 8682, '<td valign="top">Great, absolutely great.</td>', 'Great, absolutely great.', '2003-05-15 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(298681, 21149, 8682, '<td valign="top">I love the composition</td>', 'I love the composition', '2003-05-15 03:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(298682, 21219, 8682, '<td valign="top">Amazing</td>', 'Amazing', '2003-05-15 03:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(298742, 21127, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well, it made me stop for a moment, at least. I don''t think though that there''s anything I really like about this - as an abstract shot there''s obviously nothing wrong with it at all - in fact there''s a lot that good about it, but I just don''t find it interesting. For me, just as a grat subject poorly photographed is still a poor photo, a well photographed poor subject is still a poor photo.</td>', 'Well, it made me stop for a moment, at least. I don''t think though that there''s anything I really like about this - as an abstract shot there''s obviously nothing wrong with it at all - in fact there''s a lot that good about it, but I just don''t find it interesting. For me, just as a grat subject poorly photographed is still a poor photo, a well photographed poor subject is still a poor photo.', '2003-05-15 06:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(298743, 21152, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though it feels washed out a little by the over-exposure. less time would have saturated the colours more. Good work though, has potential.</td>', 'Nice shot, though it feels washed out a little by the over-exposure. less time would have saturated the colours more. Good work though, has potential.', '2003-05-15 06:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(298744, 21086, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whoa, steady on the bordering there! way too much ... Nice photo behind that, but it really distracts from it.</td>', 'Whoa, steady on the bordering there! way too much ... Nice photo behind that, but it really distracts from it.', '2003-05-15 06:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(298745, 21095, 6999, '<td valign="top">But it''s black ... :-)</td>', 'But it''s black ... :-)', '2003-05-15 06:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(298750, 21146, 6999, '<td valign="top">By far the best of a really not impressive set of entries - geat lighting, though the slight over-exposure is a minor issue: that yellow''s bleached out quite a lot, though obviously much shorter a shutter would perhaps have left the dark too dark. Texture on the basket is wonderful.</td>', 'By far the best of a really not impressive set of entries - geat lighting, though the slight over-exposure is a minor issue: that yellow''s bleached out quite a lot, though obviously much shorter a shutter would perhaps have left the dark too dark. Texture on the basket is wonderful.', '2003-05-15 06:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(298777, 20890, 3084, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful picture.  I wish that I took it.  It is vivid, expressive, and fun.  I just wish that the little girls eyes were looking at the viewer, it would have changed it a great deal and made a stronger connection.  Great work, lovely child. 10 Morgan</td>', 'What a wonderful picture.  I wish that I took it.  It is vivid, expressive, and fun.  I just wish that the little girls eyes were looking at the viewer, it would have changed it a great deal and made a stronger connection.  Great work, lovely child. 10 Morgan', '2003-05-15 07:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(298780, 21089, 3084, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful picture.  I wish that I took it.  It is vivid, expressive, and fun.  It is almost unreal.  Are the butterflies real?  Is it Photoshop?  Wonderful work, regardless. 10 Morgan</td>', 'What a wonderful picture.  I wish that I took it.  It is vivid, expressive, and fun.  It is almost unreal.  Are the butterflies real?  Is it Photoshop?  Wonderful work, regardless. 10 Morgan', '2003-05-15 07:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(298781, 21180, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great work, superior image. 9 Morgan</td>', 'Great work, superior image. 9 Morgan', '2003-05-15 07:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(298782, 21085, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great work, superior image. 9 Morgan</td>', 'Great work, superior image. 9 Morgan', '2003-05-15 07:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(298784, 21170, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great work, wonderful image. 8 Morgan</td>', 'Great work, wonderful image. 8 Morgan', '2003-05-15 07:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(298785, 21212, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great work, wonderful image. 8 Morgan</td>', 'Great work, wonderful image. 8 Morgan', '2003-05-15 07:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(298787, 20998, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great work, wonderful image. 8 Morgan</td>', 'Great work, wonderful image. 8 Morgan', '2003-05-15 07:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(298809, 20626, 1826, '<td valign="top">The white background was an excellent choice.</td>', 'The white background was an excellent choice.', '2003-05-15 08:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(298810, 21127, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wish you''d added a yellow one too.</td>', 'Wish you''d added a yellow one too.', '2003-05-15 08:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(298813, 21146, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2003-05-15 08:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(298814, 21182, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice bold color.</td>', 'Nice bold color.', '2003-05-15 08:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(298815, 20998, 1826, '<td valign="top">This is just spectacular! Excellent job with the challenge! 10</td>', 'This is just spectacular! Excellent job with the challenge! 10', '2003-05-15 08:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(298816, 20769, 1826, '<td valign="top">Low the low angle here.</td>', 'Low the low angle here.', '2003-05-15 08:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(298817, 20890, 1826, '<td valign="top">What a cutie. :)</td>', 'What a cutie. :)', '2003-05-15 08:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(298818, 21220, 1826, '<td valign="top">Love that bold color on black, it really pops.</td>', 'Love that bold color on black, it really pops.', '2003-05-15 08:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(298820, 21219, 1826, '<td valign="top">Love the way you got in so close. Very cute!</td>', 'Love the way you got in so close. Very cute!', '2003-05-15 08:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(298821, 21212, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colors. I bet this was more fun to shoot than it was to clean up afterwards!</td>', 'Nice bold colors. I bet this was more fun to shoot than it was to clean up afterwards!', '2003-05-15 08:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(298823, 21004, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, great colors.</td>', 'Nicely composed, great colors.', '2003-05-15 08:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(298967, 20961, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition... the focus seems to be a little soft on the right side of the image... I can''t really see a benefit in that... =5</td>', 'Interesting composition... the focus seems to be a little soft on the right side of the image... I can''t really see a benefit in that... =5', '2003-05-15 11:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(299001, 20626, 6900, '<td valign="top">The red looks so liquified - it''s beautiful.  I like the backlighting casting shadows forward.  I  may have tried to include the tops of these - if there was no reason for not doing so.  Excellent shot all around. 9</td>', 'The red looks so liquified - it''s beautiful.  I like the backlighting casting shadows forward.  I  may have tried to include the tops of these - if there was no reason for not doing so.  Excellent shot all around. 9', '2003-05-15 12:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(299003, 21212, 6900, '<td valign="top">They may be in cahoots, but I''m surprised that they didn''t run together and blend!  Great shot, vibrant, beautiful colors.</td>', 'They may be in cahoots, but I''m surprised that they didn''t run together and blend!  Great shot, vibrant, beautiful colors.', '2003-05-15 12:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(299006, 21180, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like this idea - i think your lighting is just a touch hot on the colors and on the tubes.  The shadows show the light coming directly from top right.  I''d try to diffuse this light a bit or change the angles to remove these shadows.  Great idea and execution. 9</td>', 'I like this idea - i think your lighting is just a touch hot on the colors and on the tubes.  The shadows show the light coming directly from top right.  I''d try to diffuse this light a bit or change the angles to remove these shadows.  Great idea and execution. 9', '2003-05-15 12:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(299008, 21149, 6900, '<td valign="top">Just a hair over exposed, but I like the rope- it''s very bright and colorful - perfectly primary!  Good job here. 9</td>', 'Just a hair over exposed, but I like the rope- it''s very bright and colorful - perfectly primary!  Good job here. 9', '2003-05-15 12:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(299013, 20986, 6900, '<td valign="top">I love this composition.  The diagonals work very well.  I''m not so high on the shadows in the LLC, but otherwise the lighting is pretty great.  If you swapped the red and yellow, perhaps the light wouldl make the red a tad brighter and not overexpose the yellows so much - they are very bright, almost too bright.  Great shot. 9</td>', 'I love this composition.  The diagonals work very well.  I''m not so high on the shadows in the LLC, but otherwise the lighting is pretty great.  If you swapped the red and yellow, perhaps the light wouldl make the red a tad brighter and not overexpose the yellows so much - they are very bright, almost too bright.  Great shot. 9', '2003-05-15 12:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(299015, 21004, 6900, '<td valign="top">I wish the pistil/stamen were more yellowy instead of green, and I can''t imagine that''s much more than a hue adjustment - the red/yellow/blue you have here is absolutely wonderful.  The composition says that you knew exactly what you were going for here - the blue negative space is excellent.  Great all around. 9</td>', 'I wish the pistil/stamen were more yellowy instead of green, and I can''t imagine that''s much more than a hue adjustment - the red/yellow/blue you have here is absolutely wonderful.  The composition says that you knew exactly what you were going for here - the blue negative space is excellent.  Great all around. 9', '2003-05-15 12:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(299016, 21086, 6900, '<td valign="top">Such a childlike atmosphere in this shot.  The border really ADDS to this pic - and that''s saying something.  Excellent use of availables!</td>', 'Such a childlike atmosphere in this shot.  The border really ADDS to this pic - and that''s saying something.  Excellent use of availables!', '2003-05-15 12:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(299019, 21089, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great use of color - solitary colors here work extremely well among the repetitious greens.  I would have actually put the blue or red closest, since their colors are more striking and exciting.  Great work here either way. 8</td>', 'Great use of color - solitary colors here work extremely well among the repetitious greens.  I would have actually put the blue or red closest, since their colors are more striking and exciting.  Great work here either way. 8', '2003-05-15 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(299020, 21089, 6523, '<td valign="top">How DID you do this??  However you did it (are the butterflies fake?), it''s a very creative concept and a terrific photo!  I gave it a 10 -- hope it wins a ribbon!</td>', 'How DID you do this??  However you did it (are the butterflies fake?), it''s a very creative concept and a terrific photo!  I gave it a 10 -- hope it wins a ribbon!', '2003-05-15 12:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(299021, 21206, 6900, '<td valign="top">This shot is definitely blurry, the light in the candle turned into a big blur, and there is way too much going on. Nice effort, keep shooting.</td>', 'This shot is definitely blurry, the light in the candle turned into a big blur, and there is way too much going on. Nice effort, keep shooting.', '2003-05-15 12:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(299022, 20950, 6900, '<td valign="top">Who peed on the flag?  Doesn''t work because it''s unnatural.  There ARE red/yellow/blue flags...</td>', 'Who peed on the flag?  Doesn''t work because it''s unnatural.  There ARE red/yellow/blue flags...', '2003-05-15 12:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(299024, 20998, 6523, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  It looks to me like one of your light sources is back lighting, is that correct?  Definitely a 10 for concept and execution!</td>', 'Great photo!  It looks to me like one of your light sources is back lighting, is that correct?  Definitely a 10 for concept and execution!', '2003-05-15 12:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(299026, 21130, 6900, '<td valign="top">Interesting post processing.  I don''t see any yellow and the red you have is pink.  Really it''s just a blue sky with some saturation issues.</td>', 'Interesting post processing.  I don''t see any yellow and the red you have is pink.  Really it''s just a blue sky with some saturation issues.', '2003-05-15 12:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(299028, 21031, 6900, '<td valign="top">There are so many shades of red here that it''s wonderful.  I read into the challenge that we needed or should have 3 colors - so I''m obliged to mark it down for that, but compositionally and colorwise it''s nice.  I am not fond of the direct harsh lighting but it brings out the colors.</td>', 'There are so many shades of red here that it''s wonderful.  I read into the challenge that we needed or should have 3 colors - so I''m obliged to mark it down for that, but compositionally and colorwise it''s nice.  I am not fond of the direct harsh lighting but it brings out the colors.', '2003-05-15 12:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(299029, 21085, 6523, '<td valign="top">Great concept - great photo!  I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Great concept - great photo!  I gave it a 10.', '2003-05-15 12:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(299031, 21204, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of the ''blues'' but her pants are also blue.  Nice shot - surprised you could get a cam into a show these days!  Good job.</td>', 'I like your interpretation of the ''blues'' but her pants are also blue.  Nice shot - surprised you could get a cam into a show these days!  Good job.', '2003-05-15 12:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(299033, 21173, 6900, '<td valign="top">This seems a little blurry and the yellow is a tad blown out on the corner.  The background here distracts from the smooth lines and soft feel of this kids'' toy.</td>', 'This seems a little blurry and the yellow is a tad blown out on the corner.  The background here distracts from the smooth lines and soft feel of this kids'' toy.', '2003-05-15 12:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(299039, 21108, 6900, '<td valign="top">I''m so torn over this shot.  Half of me says "look at how well someone used soft focus, added a blur and composed a beautiful shot.  The other half of me says the yellows are blown out, the ones underneath look crushed and this shot could have been done so much better.  I''m torn!</td>', 'I''m so torn over this shot.  Half of me says "look at how well someone used soft focus, added a blur and composed a beautiful shot.  The other half of me says the yellows are blown out, the ones underneath look crushed and this shot could have been done so much better.  I''m torn!', '2003-05-15 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(299040, 20851, 6523, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of using the filters -- and I find the arrangement you made for the photo very aesthetically appealing.  If this were an ad, I''d probably think about buying them.  :)</td>', 'I like the idea of using the filters -- and I find the arrangement you made for the photo very aesthetically appealing.  If this were an ad, I''d probably think about buying them.  :)', '2003-05-15 12:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(299042, 20893, 6900, '<td valign="top">Front of the ring is way too blurry - the challenge is primaries and while I see them on the sides leading to the secondaries, it''s the balls that I see as the center of the shot.  Good effort.</td>', 'Front of the ring is way too blurry - the challenge is primaries and while I see them on the sides leading to the secondaries, it''s the balls that I see as the center of the shot.  Good effort.', '2003-05-15 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(299045, 21095, 6900, '<td valign="top">No blues, no reds!  Aaahhhh!  Ok, good shot of this creature.  Excellent focus - I wish for more color!</td>', 'No blues, no reds!  Aaahhhh!  Ok, good shot of this creature.  Excellent focus - I wish for more color!', '2003-05-15 12:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(299046, 21194, 6900, '<td valign="top">Extremely blurry.  Good pose - could use the reds and blues, too.</td>', 'Extremely blurry.  Good pose - could use the reds and blues, too.', '2003-05-15 12:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(299049, 21064, 6900, '<td valign="top">I see bright red and a very harsh light reflection.  Could have done more with this.  Nice effort to get out there and shoot, however.</td>', 'I see bright red and a very harsh light reflection.  Could have done more with this.  Nice effort to get out there and shoot, however.', '2003-05-15 12:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(299050, 20870, 6900, '<td valign="top">A good shot with a strange DoF (the green stamen is blurry, but the LLC is all in focus?)  Good use of yellows, but no reds and blues.</td>', 'A good shot with a strange DoF (the green stamen is blurry, but the LLC is all in focus?)  Good use of yellows, but no reds and blues.', '2003-05-15 12:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(299051, 20961, 6900, '<td valign="top">THe focus is definitely off here.  Good use of all 3 colors!</td>', 'THe focus is definitely off here.  Good use of all 3 colors!', '2003-05-15 12:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(299053, 21088, 6523, '<td valign="top">Nice concept here -- the yellow flag seems to have a lot of green and/or black in it, which isn''t your fault because that''s the way you found them .  I think I might have cropped it so that there was a lot mroe red flag and lot less yellow flag in order to minimize that problem.  Good work finding the colors in nature and getting a well-focused shot of them, though!</td>', 'Nice concept here -- the yellow flag seems to have a lot of green and/or black in it, which isn''t your fault because that''s the way you found them .  I think I might have cropped it so that there was a lot mroe red flag and lot less yellow flag in order to minimize that problem.  Good work finding the colors in nature and getting a well-focused shot of them, though!', '2003-05-15 12:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(299055, 21185, 6900, '<td valign="top">Torn on this shot.  I like the composition - don''t like the blown out background.  I like the red, but it''s lacking blues and yellows to make it perfect.  Great shot though.</td>', 'Torn on this shot.  I like the composition - don''t like the blown out background.  I like the red, but it''s lacking blues and yellows to make it perfect.  Great shot though.', '2003-05-15 12:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(299056, 21219, 6900, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a better shot from Flora challenge (Here Mommy This is for You).  Kid''s hand is overexposed and looks like he''s about to eat your primary!  :)</td>', 'Reminds me of a better shot from Flora challenge (Here Mommy This is for You).  Kid''s hand is overexposed and looks like he''s about to eat your primary!  :)', '2003-05-15 12:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(299059, 21103, 6900, '<td valign="top">"why?" <br/>Why did you place them here?  (separation?)<br/>Why did you take this shot at the hour you did?  (harsh reflection on the red ball)<br/>Why did you use a blue background when your composition already included blue?<br/> <br/>:)  Just a few questions to ask - hope they help!</td>', '"why?" Why did you place them here?  (separation?)Why did you take this shot at the hour you did?  (harsh reflection on the red ball)Why did you use a blue background when your composition already included blue? :)  Just a few questions to ask - hope they help!', '2003-05-15 12:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(299060, 20890, 6523, '<td valign="top">I love this shot -- that nice diffuse cloudy day lighting that works so well with portraits, and the primary colors are used subtly enough to be really interesting here.</td>', 'I love this shot -- that nice diffuse cloudy day lighting that works so well with portraits, and the primary colors are used subtly enough to be really interesting here.', '2003-05-15 12:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(299061, 21071, 6523, '<td valign="top">Simple, but very effective.  Nice work!</td>', 'Simple, but very effective.  Nice work!', '2003-05-15 12:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(299064, 21203, 6523, '<td valign="top">Very effective photo -- excellent use of composition and color.</td>', 'Very effective photo -- excellent use of composition and color.', '2003-05-15 12:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(299067, 21053, 6523, '<td valign="top">I love it when people find natural subjects to fit the color themes, and this is a great shot.</td>', 'I love it when people find natural subjects to fit the color themes, and this is a great shot.', '2003-05-15 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(299071, 21133, 6523, '<td valign="top">Did you mean to enter this photo in Secondary Colors?  It''s a great photo for that -- but there''s no primary colors in it.</td>', 'Did you mean to enter this photo in Secondary Colors?  It''s a great photo for that -- but there''s no primary colors in it.', '2003-05-15 13:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(299082, 20893, 6523, '<td valign="top">The Playdoh (?)is a good idea for the primary color theme, but I think the photo itself would be a bit better if the elements in it were simpler in composition (just the big blocks of color, or the strand of combined colors, perhaps.  There''s a lot to look at in the photo, and my eye went right to the balls, possibly because the center of focus is really on the purple ball.  The primary colors don''t really come across clearly as the subject of the photo because of its complexity.</td>', 'The Playdoh (?)is a good idea for the primary color theme, but I think the photo itself would be a bit better if the elements in it were simpler in composition (just the big blocks of color, or the strand of combined colors, perhaps.  There''s a lot to look at in the photo, and my eye went right to the balls, possibly because the center of focus is really on the purple ball.  The primary colors don''t really come across clearly as the subject of the photo because of its complexity.', '2003-05-15 13:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(299085, 20996, 6523, '<td valign="top">What a great subject!  I only use straight aspirin so it never would have occurred to me that pain relief actually comes in primary colors -- good work!</td>', 'What a great subject!  I only use straight aspirin so it never would have occurred to me that pain relief actually comes in primary colors -- good work!', '2003-05-15 13:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(299098, 20998, 8608, '<td valign="top">Nice pair of glasses...  excellent</td>', 'Nice pair of glasses...  excellent', '2003-05-15 13:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(299101, 20997, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful abstract - strong lines in the foreground which really strengthen the composition and wonderful soft curves behind - i like the sweeping black curve and the smaller brighe ones. That black circle is also just right. <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'What a wonderful abstract - strong lines in the foreground which really strengthen the composition and wonderful soft curves behind - i like the sweeping black curve and the smaller brighe ones. That black circle is also just right. Good luck!', '2003-05-15 13:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(299104, 21221, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot - great saturation in the reds and blues. Lighting doesn''t feel quite right - the yellow is bouncing quite a lot of it off which means the yellow seems paler whereas the red ribbon is in the shadow in some areas.<br/>Great composition.</td>', 'Nice simple shot - great saturation in the reds and blues. Lighting doesn''t feel quite right - the yellow is bouncing quite a lot of it off which means the yellow seems paler whereas the red ribbon is in the shadow in some areas.Great composition.', '2003-05-15 13:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(299109, 20551, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely and simple and very striking - I particularly like that touch of red and yellow in the centre.<br/></td>', 'Lovely and simple and very striking - I particularly like that touch of red and yellow in the centre.', '2003-05-15 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(299112, 21174, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this - simple composition and strong colour. The background has some gradiation of colour but otherwise it''s great. This reminds me of one of the artworks based on the London Underground (Tube) - I can''t recall the name but I will see if I can find it on the internet.<br/> <br/>edit: Tate Gallery - 1986 - David Booth</td>', 'I really like this - simple composition and strong colour. The background has some gradiation of colour but otherwise it''s great. This reminds me of one of the artworks based on the London Underground (Tube) - I can''t recall the name but I will see if I can find it on the internet. edit: Tate Gallery - 1986 - David Booth', '2003-05-15 13:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(299113, 20948, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great composition and nice light and shadow. This is great!</td>', 'Great composition and nice light and shadow. This is great!', '2003-05-15 13:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(299114, 20998, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is great - a clever and very striking variation on a theme that had started to become a little tired recently... Really beautiful.</td>', 'This is great - a clever and very striking variation on a theme that had started to become a little tired recently... Really beautiful.', '2003-05-15 13:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(299116, 21213, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful - I love the textures - and it''s quite contradictory - the balls have clean shapes yet a fuzzy texture but the background is made of fuzzy shapes with a texture that looks smooth! :o) I love the composition and direction of lines. It''s great that you didn''t line all the tennis ball white lines up - I think that would have been far too regimented - I like your more random look very much.</td>', 'This is beautiful - I love the textures - and it''s quite contradictory - the balls have clean shapes yet a fuzzy texture but the background is made of fuzzy shapes with a texture that looks smooth! :o) I love the composition and direction of lines. It''s great that you didn''t line all the tennis ball white lines up - I think that would have been far too regimented - I like your more random look very much.', '2003-05-15 13:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(299119, 21004, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is very striking and I like the composition. The border isn''t right for the image in my opinion. I like the slightly mottled appearance of the background blue.</td>', 'This is very striking and I like the composition. The border isn''t right for the image in my opinion. I like the slightly mottled appearance of the background blue.', '2003-05-15 13:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(299191, 20626, 3087, '<td valign="top">Ooh this is clever - is the one vase actually yellow and red or did you use some clever lighting or liquid content? I like the even lighting - not too strong or too feeble - brings out the colour of the glass. The composition is nice. The background is a little bland in comparison to the glass and I think the crop at the top feels a little odd - not sure whether it might be better to include a touch more vase necks?</td>', 'Ooh this is clever - is the one vase actually yellow and red or did you use some clever lighting or liquid content? I like the even lighting - not too strong or too feeble - brings out the colour of the glass. The composition is nice. The background is a little bland in comparison to the glass and I think the crop at the top feels a little odd - not sure whether it might be better to include a touch more vase necks?', '2003-05-15 15:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(299223, 21108, 6660, '<td valign="top">I like the flowers you have used and the attempt you have made in adjusting the colours, unfortunately it has been let down a bit by the "halos" created around the flowers on the left. I am assuming that this is largely due to the compression you have put on saving this file - you have only used 30KB of your 150KB that you could have used. Try redoing this picture, however use less compression when saving and see if the halo effect re-occurs.</td>', 'I like the flowers you have used and the attempt you have made in adjusting the colours, unfortunately it has been let down a bit by the "halos" created around the flowers on the left. I am assuming that this is largely due to the compression you have put on saving this file - you have only used 30KB of your 150KB that you could have used. Try redoing this picture, however use less compression when saving and see if the halo effect re-occurs.', '2003-05-15 15:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(299246, 20996, 7350, '<td valign="top">Must''ve taken forever to arrange them like that!  I like the black background, but you have sacrificed the brighness of the colors and the white pill bottles to achieve it, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Must''ve taken forever to arrange them like that!  I like the black background, but you have sacrificed the brighness of the colors and the white pill bottles to achieve it, I''m afraid.', '2003-05-15 16:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(299298, 20950, 8488, '<td valign="top">Uhm. Why are the white bits yellow? It''s very odd-looking. The first impression that jumps to my mind (besides ''he turned up the yellow in photoshop for no reason'') is ''Wow, someone peed on the flag.'' Probably not what you intended.</td>', 'Uhm. Why are the white bits yellow? It''s very odd-looking. The first impression that jumps to my mind (besides ''he turned up the yellow in photoshop for no reason'') is ''Wow, someone peed on the flag.'' Probably not what you intended.', '2003-05-15 17:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(299299, 21202, 8488, '<td valign="top">This shot looks like it''s trying to be avant-garde, but it''s not really *about* anything and it''s lit really weird so it doesn''t end up achieving anything, really, IMHO. It''s got diagonal composition, which can be good, but in this case looks like it was thrown in ''to make it more interesting.'' That really only works when what you''re photographing has a little interest of its own. Also, given that the flag is lit far darker than anything else in the frame, it almost looks like it''s fallen down a little itself-shaped hole, a very odd effect (and probably not intended).</td>', 'This shot looks like it''s trying to be avant-garde, but it''s not really *about* anything and it''s lit really weird so it doesn''t end up achieving anything, really, IMHO. It''s got diagonal composition, which can be good, but in this case looks like it was thrown in ''to make it more interesting.'' That really only works when what you''re photographing has a little interest of its own. Also, given that the flag is lit far darker than anything else in the frame, it almost looks like it''s fallen down a little itself-shaped hole, a very odd effect (and probably not intended).', '2003-05-15 17:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(299303, 21022, 8488, '<td valign="top">The lighting and saturation on this shot, combined with the very soft focus (or overprocessing, depending how you got the effect) on most of the strawberries, combines to make me think my glasses aren''t on straight. The colors might have been better contrasted by a not-yellow plate, something to make it clear there IS a white or non-red value somewhere in the frame. Just thinking out loud. :-&gt; Also, the composition''s kind of ... all over the place. There''s no one place the eyes are drawn or directed, no center of attention.</td>', 'The lighting and saturation on this shot, combined with the very soft focus (or overprocessing, depending how you got the effect) on most of the strawberries, combines to make me think my glasses aren''t on straight. The colors might have been better contrasted by a not-yellow plate, something to make it clear there IS a white or non-red value somewhere in the frame. Just thinking out loud. :-> Also, the composition''s kind of ... all over the place. There''s no one place the eyes are drawn or directed, no center of attention.', '2003-05-15 17:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(299304, 21127, 8488, '<td valign="top">The focus and crop and general lighting, etc, combine to make this look like you cut pieces out of construction paper and photographed them. I believe that you DID shoot balloons, but they could have been anything. :-&gt; If you wanted the balloonyness to show, different choices would have helped; if you didn''t care about the balloonyness, you could have saved yourself some trouble and just shot construction paper. :-&gt;</td>', 'The focus and crop and general lighting, etc, combine to make this look like you cut pieces out of construction paper and photographed them. I believe that you DID shoot balloons, but they could have been anything. :-> If you wanted the balloonyness to show, different choices would have helped; if you didn''t care about the balloonyness, you could have saved yourself some trouble and just shot construction paper. :->', '2003-05-15 17:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(299305, 21064, 8488, '<td valign="top">The color feels incidental, not central, to this shot, so I have to grade down a bit to leave room at the top for people who made the theme the star. Also, it''s incredibly dark and muddy-looking, except for one part of the bumper.</td>', 'The color feels incidental, not central, to this shot, so I have to grade down a bit to leave room at the top for people who made the theme the star. Also, it''s incredibly dark and muddy-looking, except for one part of the bumper.', '2003-05-15 17:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(299306, 21183, 8488, '<td valign="top">The lighting is so washed out that what I''m assuming is a vase looks like a thumb-smudge, and the values in the rose are reduced to almost paper cutouts instead of actual petals. It''s very strange-looking. The baby''s-breath is in focus, as is the hand, but not the top of the rose or the vase? Unusual choices, there.</td>', 'The lighting is so washed out that what I''m assuming is a vase looks like a thumb-smudge, and the values in the rose are reduced to almost paper cutouts instead of actual petals. It''s very strange-looking. The baby''s-breath is in focus, as is the hand, but not the top of the rose or the vase? Unusual choices, there.', '2003-05-15 17:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(299312, 20949, 8488, '<td valign="top">Dangit. You did my idea, only far better. Good for you. :-&gt; Crisp focus, nice lighting, good tight crop (to exclude, I presume, the really distracting background).</td>', 'Dangit. You did my idea, only far better. Good for you. :-> Crisp focus, nice lighting, good tight crop (to exclude, I presume, the really distracting background).', '2003-05-15 17:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
