(299451, 20998, 2634, '<td valign="top">yes I have seen this before...<br/>well done, my only complaints are that the colors are oversaturated and the line at the bottom is not quite straight.</td>', 'yes I have seen this before...well done, my only complaints are that the colors are oversaturated and the line at the bottom is not quite straight.', '2003-05-15 19:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(299460, 20890, 2634, '<td valign="top">Very nice... the colors, exposure and softness are super. I''m curious as to the camera used. Great that there are drops on the umbrella. Would have loved to see her holding it though(I am so picky). Also would have prefered no grass showing.</td>', 'Very nice... the colors, exposure and softness are super. I''m curious as to the camera used. Great that there are drops on the umbrella. Would have loved to see her holding it though(I am so picky). Also would have prefered no grass showing.', '2003-05-15 20:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(299465, 21089, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like the composition. There is something in the lower left that is bothering me. A touch too dark, but good shot overall.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like the composition. There is something in the lower left that is bothering me. A touch too dark, but good shot overall.', '2003-05-15 20:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(299469, 21099, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I really like the lighting on the background. Great focus. I think I would have preferred the red cork all in the shot and a little more light on the blue cork. Nice framing too. On closer examination, are those wine drops on the white? I know we can''t clone :(</td>', 'Nice shot. I really like the lighting on the background. Great focus. I think I would have preferred the red cork all in the shot and a little more light on the blue cork. Nice framing too. On closer examination, are those wine drops on the white? I know we can''t clone :(', '2003-05-15 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(299473, 21185, 2634, '<td valign="top">I like this idea. looks like an ad.  I would have used a different lipstick to make the shot look more glamorous though. Wet n Wild just doesn''t cut it :) Seriously though, the color on the paper is a little too magenta in color but great composition.</td>', 'I like this idea. looks like an ad.  I would have used a different lipstick to make the shot look more glamorous though. Wet n Wild just doesn''t cut it :) Seriously though, the color on the paper is a little too magenta in color but great composition.', '2003-05-15 20:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(299475, 21174, 5585, '<td valign="top">simple.. nice ..and very good</td>', 'simple.. nice ..and very good', '2003-05-15 20:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(299481, 20996, 5585, '<td valign="top">very good idea...done well</td>', 'very good idea...done well', '2003-05-15 20:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(299483, 21059, 6660, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea, however I think that your subject composition is all incorrect and you would have been better leaving out the hand in glove, and the reflected cars, by cropping to your true subject, the three bottles. I feel that this would have been far less distracting.</td>', 'Nice Idea, however I think that your subject composition is all incorrect and you would have been better leaving out the hand in glove, and the reflected cars, by cropping to your true subject, the three bottles. I feel that this would have been far less distracting.', '2003-05-15 20:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(299487, 21064, 6660, '<td valign="top">I think you might have scored a lot better if you had just taken a picture of the brilliant red spoked wheel (and yes I konw that you would then have lost out on the yellow and blue lights) however I do not feel as though they really add anything to this shot, and the the other cars in the picture are rather distracting. If you wanted to keep the lights, prehaps a tighter shot on the front wheel with just the left set of lights and the grill might have been a lot more interesting.</td>', 'I think you might have scored a lot better if you had just taken a picture of the brilliant red spoked wheel (and yes I konw that you would then have lost out on the yellow and blue lights) however I do not feel as though they really add anything to this shot, and the the other cars in the picture are rather distracting. If you wanted to keep the lights, prehaps a tighter shot on the front wheel with just the left set of lights and the grill might have been a lot more interesting.', '2003-05-15 20:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(299490, 21106, 6660, '<td valign="top">Love the use of the slinky, but am not sure about your background, I think it is a little bit too busy and you would have been better off with a blac,k one.</td>', 'Love the use of the slinky, but am not sure about your background, I think it is a little bit too busy and you would have been better off with a blac,k one.', '2003-05-15 20:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(299511, 21219, 2634, '<td valign="top">Really cute shot.  The color, composition and focus are all good. I think I might have tried a shorter DOF to blur the background. The object in the right center is a little annoying and the fingers are a touch too light. Love the eye contact, adds a great feel!</td>', 'Really cute shot.  The color, composition and focus are all good. I think I might have tried a shorter DOF to blur the background. The object in the right center is a little annoying and the fingers are a touch too light. Love the eye contact, adds a great feel!', '2003-05-15 21:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(299513, 21194, 2634, '<td valign="top">This is nice and close but it lacks the sharp focus necessary on such a close up shot. Your camera might not be able to focus at such a close range. Keep trying.</td>', 'This is nice and close but it lacks the sharp focus necessary on such a close up shot. Your camera might not be able to focus at such a close range. Keep trying.', '2003-05-15 21:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(299517, 21172, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and good DOF. The shadow on the upper portion takes away from the photo. The harsh lighting on the bottom is too bright. It is quite difficult when dealing with dirrect sun light as seems to be the case here.</td>', 'Nice idea, and good DOF. The shadow on the upper portion takes away from the photo. The harsh lighting on the bottom is too bright. It is quite difficult when dealing with dirrect sun light as seems to be the case here.', '2003-05-15 21:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(299521, 21053, 2634, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Was this the actual color of the flower? The bottom yellows are a little too light and bright. I think i would have tried a different crop or perhaps a different angle on this. It''s good, but something is missing. Good color and contrast on the sky.</td>', 'Interesting. Was this the actual color of the flower? The bottom yellows are a little too light and bright. I think i would have tried a different crop or perhaps a different angle on this. It''s good, but something is missing. Good color and contrast on the sky.', '2003-05-15 21:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(299527, 21221, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the composition here. The lighting is too harsh though. It is reflecting too brightly on the front yellow portion of the box. The red ribbons in the back are a little dark. I also see some blue in the black front portion. Can''t understand what that is.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the composition here. The lighting is too harsh though. It is reflecting too brightly on the front yellow portion of the box. The red ribbons in the back are a little dark. I also see some blue in the black front portion. Can''t understand what that is.', '2003-05-15 21:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(299534, 21084, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. This is one that I have personally tried, and I know it can be difficult. You did a good job, I think the focus could be a touch sharper in the drops.</td>', 'Nice shot. This is one that I have personally tried, and I know it can be difficult. You did a good job, I think the focus could be a touch sharper in the drops.', '2003-05-15 21:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(299537, 20962, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...just a little dark on the flower.</td>', 'Nice shot...just a little dark on the flower.', '2003-05-15 21:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(299563, 21085, 7541, '<td valign="top">Does the job for the primary challenge, but, the title says it all and I think this is excellent.  I see this topic being difficult because the wide variety of options that are available, the problem is selecting the right one.</td>', 'Does the job for the primary challenge, but, the title says it all and I think this is excellent.  I see this topic being difficult because the wide variety of options that are available, the problem is selecting the right one.', '2003-05-15 21:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(299629, 20551, 6771, '<td valign="top">great combo and look.  little OOF.  Is this a droplet photo from the top?  How did ya get the opposite colors inside?  Great job there</td>', 'great combo and look.  little OOF.  Is this a droplet photo from the top?  How did ya get the opposite colors inside?  Great job there', '2003-05-15 22:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(299630, 21142, 6771, '<td valign="top">Original idea.  I would like to see the DOF deeper (back of the clips).  Background is a bit noisy, but that happens with jpg compression.  the shadow is a bit distracting. And I am not really a big fan of borders, but this one is decent.</td>', 'Original idea.  I would like to see the DOF deeper (back of the clips).  Background is a bit noisy, but that happens with jpg compression.  the shadow is a bit distracting. And I am not really a big fan of borders, but this one is decent.', '2003-05-15 22:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(299632, 20998, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the inverse colors that happens with this.  background has some noise, but jpg compression does that.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the inverse colors that happens with this.  background has some noise, but jpg compression does that.', '2003-05-15 22:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(299638, 21207, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Get ''the party''s over" effect.  Focus is decent, but the red and yellow look a bit "washed out" and can''t see the same detail as in the blue one.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Get ''the party''s over" effect.  Focus is decent, but the red and yellow look a bit "washed out" and can''t see the same detail as in the blue one.', '2003-05-15 22:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(299642, 21219, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the child''s face.  Little blur from movement in the flower.  Faster shutter speed would fix that (especially with kid''s).  Not sure if enough light for faster shutter though.</td>', 'Great focus on the child''s face.  Little blur from movement in the flower.  Faster shutter speed would fix that (especially with kid''s).  Not sure if enough light for faster shutter though.', '2003-05-15 22:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(299645, 20719, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great compostion!!  Love the stuff (leaves) in the water.  Bit longer DOF to have the rose in more focus to match the other one.  The front flower appears more of a light orange color to me, but who cares.  (C:</td>', 'Great compostion!!  Love the stuff (leaves) in the water.  Bit longer DOF to have the rose in more focus to match the other one.  The front flower appears more of a light orange color to me, but who cares.  (C:', '2003-05-15 22:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(299648, 20986, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this one.  Has good shadows, etc. and not harsh.  Hard to tell if the focus is a touch off, mainly because the yellow "looks" like it.  Might just be a contrast thing though</td>', 'I like the lighting on this one.  Has good shadows, etc. and not harsh.  Hard to tell if the focus is a touch off, mainly because the yellow "looks" like it.  Might just be a contrast thing though', '2003-05-15 22:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(299650, 21206, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and idea of this.  Looks like a great shot for a romantic idea.  It is OOF.  Most notably on th flowers and seen more on the balls.  Maybe a touch more light and/or some illuminating it from the back</td>', 'I like the composition and idea of this.  Looks like a great shot for a romantic idea.  It is OOF.  Most notably on th flowers and seen more on the balls.  Maybe a touch more light and/or some illuminating it from the back', '2003-05-15 22:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(299663, 21152, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great pastel colors, shadow and lighting.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Great pastel colors, shadow and lighting.  Nice capture.', '2003-05-15 22:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(299667, 21121, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and DOF.  I would like to have seem it a bit more symmetrical (ie: the yellow pipe entering and leaving the photo at the corners)</td>', 'Nice lighting and DOF.  I would like to have seem it a bit more symmetrical (ie: the yellow pipe entering and leaving the photo at the corners)', '2003-05-15 22:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
