(299673, 21004, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great Macro shot, DOF and focus.  Don''t think I can make much of any "negative" criticism.</td>', 'Great Macro shot, DOF and focus.  Don''t think I can make much of any "negative" criticism.', '2003-05-15 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(299681, 21118, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Touch more DOF (the bluebells seem just a tad fuzzy).  I think a polarizing filter would have helped this too.  Taken away the reflections and see more of the greenish color on the bottom of the lake or whatever.</td>', 'Great composition.  Touch more DOF (the bluebells seem just a tad fuzzy).  I think a polarizing filter would have helped this too.  Taken away the reflections and see more of the greenish color on the bottom of the lake or whatever.', '2003-05-15 22:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(299685, 20997, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The background works great. I would like a bit more brighter light, but the half shadow on the bars looks cool</td>', 'Great composition.  The background works great. I would like a bit more brighter light, but the half shadow on the bars looks cool', '2003-05-15 22:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(299709, 21069, 6771, '<td valign="top">Looks like Prom decorations.  Nice color and composition.  A touch harsh lighting in the left side on the tops of the lai''s (sp).  The red looks a bit washed out from it</td>', 'Looks like Prom decorations.  Nice color and composition.  A touch harsh lighting in the left side on the tops of the lai''s (sp).  The red looks a bit washed out from it', '2003-05-15 23:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(299713, 20961, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I would like to see deeper DOF to have the red all in focus, also.  It seems to blur towards the right side of the photo.  the texture of the background is a bit distracting and that stray petal</td>', 'Good composition.  I would like to see deeper DOF to have the red all in focus, also.  It seems to blur towards the right side of the photo.  the texture of the background is a bit distracting and that stray petal', '2003-05-15 23:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(299716, 21209, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and focus on a tough subject.  I am aware of this from a similar type of photo in a different challenge.  It is a primary color, the others are not present, but not sure that is EXACTLY what the rules said, so....6</td>', 'Great lighting and focus on a tough subject.  I am aware of this from a similar type of photo in a different challenge.  It is a primary color, the others are not present, but not sure that is EXACTLY what the rules said, so....6', '2003-05-15 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(299722, 21185, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is a very well done shot.  Great lighting  (almost deleted all of the shadow) no harsh areas.  I guess the only thing I can say is that touch tighter focus (if you want it tack sharp) at the lettering.<br/>Still not totally sure on the challenge for having all three colors, but who cares...7</td>', 'This is a very well done shot.  Great lighting  (almost deleted all of the shadow) no harsh areas.  I guess the only thing I can say is that touch tighter focus (if you want it tack sharp) at the lettering.Still not totally sure on the challenge for having all three colors, but who cares...7', '2003-05-15 23:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(299728, 20948, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!.  Not sure if the soft focus is intentional, but I would like to see it sharper on the rims of the subject.  Low key, but this works great here</td>', 'Excellent composition!.  Not sure if the soft focus is intentional, but I would like to see it sharper on the rims of the subject.  Low key, but this works great here', '2003-05-15 23:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(299735, 21182, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  It looks strange to the eye.  Not sure about the cropping, the left top corner stem is a bit distracitng.  Mainly because it is messing with my focus.  I think a darker blue background may have worked a bit better.</td>', 'Great perspective.  It looks strange to the eye.  Not sure about the cropping, the left top corner stem is a bit distracitng.  Mainly because it is messing with my focus.  I think a darker blue background may have worked a bit better.', '2003-05-15 23:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(299739, 21089, 6771, '<td valign="top">Fantasy is right.  Try to get three real ones to hold still long enough for such a great shot!  (C:  Great colors and DOF.  I love them within the green plants, adds alot of contrast and interest to the shot</td>', 'Fantasy is right.  Try to get three real ones to hold still long enough for such a great shot!  (C:  Great colors and DOF.  I love them within the green plants, adds alot of contrast and interest to the shot', '2003-05-15 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(299745, 21146, 6771, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting on this.  I like the harshly lit area that contrasts with the immediate shadowed area.  The colors look a bit muted, but with everything oversaturated these days, looks good.  Looks like a JJ.   (C:</td>', 'Excellent lighting on this.  I like the harshly lit area that contrasts with the immediate shadowed area.  The colors look a bit muted, but with everything oversaturated these days, looks good.  Looks like a JJ.   (C:', '2003-05-15 23:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(299750, 21205, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice Macro.  REAL close there.  the colors are a bit muted it seems.  Greater DOF may have brought the closest red one in a bit better focus.  Good composition</td>', 'Very nice Macro.  REAL close there.  the colors are a bit muted it seems.  Greater DOF may have brought the closest red one in a bit better focus.  Good composition', '2003-05-15 23:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(299757, 21194, 6771, '<td valign="top">Tough subject to catch in focus.  That seems to be the biggest problem with this.  The top of his head (black area) melts into the background, so I think a bit more lighting overhead would have cured that, if possible to do</td>', 'Tough subject to catch in focus.  That seems to be the biggest problem with this.  The top of his head (black area) melts into the background, so I think a bit more lighting overhead would have cured that, if possible to do', '2003-05-15 23:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(299759, 21053, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great perspcecitve and colors.  It appears to be leaning a touch to the left.  Maybe a little tighter cropping on the sides to decrease some of the negative space, and more of the stem included to show more of the plant.</td>', 'Great perspcecitve and colors.  It appears to be leaning a touch to the left.  Maybe a little tighter cropping on the sides to decrease some of the negative space, and more of the stem included to show more of the plant.', '2003-05-15 23:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(299765, 21115, 6771, '<td valign="top">East Meets West!!  Great shot!  I have not "negative" criticism for this.  Is a kitchen wall piece for sure.</td>', 'East Meets West!!  Great shot!  I have not "negative" criticism for this.  Is a kitchen wall piece for sure.', '2003-05-15 23:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(299772, 21071, 6771, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the lighting.  I think the cropping/composition could have been a bit different.  Maybe  cut off at half the bowl and plate and an equal portion of the red??  Nice shot though.  Some distracting stuff in the red area.</td>', 'I like the colors and the lighting.  I think the cropping/composition could have been a bit different.  Maybe  cut off at half the bowl and plate and an equal portion of the red??  Nice shot though.  Some distracting stuff in the red area.', '2003-05-15 23:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(299774, 21217, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract with the food colors!  Me like.  Lots of lines and swirls to look at.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract with the food colors!  Me like.  Lots of lines and swirls to look at.', '2003-05-15 23:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(299775, 21170, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Not much else to improve on here</td>', 'Great shot.  Not much else to improve on here', '2003-05-15 23:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(299776, 20962, 6771, '<td valign="top">Is that a Hawaiian type?  jk  Very nice shot.  Great everything.  Maybe just a touch more light, but it still looks great.</td>', 'Is that a Hawaiian type?  jk  Very nice shot.  Great everything.  Maybe just a touch more light, but it still looks great.', '2003-05-15 23:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(299778, 21174, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clean.  Not too sure on the shadows.  Pretty intense light, but gives it a surgical/sterile feel to it</td>', 'Very crisp and clean.  Not too sure on the shadows.  Pretty intense light, but gives it a surgical/sterile feel to it', '2003-05-15 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(299780, 20947, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and focus.  Nice shot</td>', 'Great DOF and focus.  Nice shot', '2003-05-15 23:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(299783, 20952, 6771, '<td valign="top">The perspective seems odd.  It looks like it is squeezing  at the bottom of the photo.  The right side is sort of flaring to the right and left to left as it goes up.  Is messing with my eyes.</td>', 'The perspective seems odd.  It looks like it is squeezing  at the bottom of the photo.  The right side is sort of flaring to the right and left to left as it goes up.  Is messing with my eyes.', '2003-05-15 23:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(299784, 21092, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great colors and perspective.  A touch brighter would help in my opinion.  the horizon line is off a bit goin up from right to left.</td>', 'Great colors and perspective.  A touch brighter would help in my opinion.  the horizon line is off a bit goin up from right to left.', '2003-05-16 00:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(299788, 20851, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  A touch more diffuse lighting to bring out the detail on the rings a touch more.  Most likely said before, but the cropping may have been better with a little more space around the filters to see the full shadows and even(ing) out the spacing, and then the rotation part not sure of, but making it a bit more symmetrical again with like a diamond in a square</td>', 'Nice idea.  A touch more diffuse lighting to bring out the detail on the rings a touch more.  Most likely said before, but the cropping may have been better with a little more space around the filters to see the full shadows and even(ing) out the spacing, and then the rotation part not sure of, but making it a bit more symmetrical again with like a diamond in a square', '2003-05-16 00:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(299791, 21172, 6771, '<td valign="top">That is just freaky looking.  First look at it and it looks like it is a digitally PS  block picture.  Il ike the lighting/shadow and the way it looks like he is waiting to come on the court.  If you also made this out of legos, personally, I am EXTREMEly impressed.</td>', 'That is just freaky looking.  First look at it and it looks like it is a digitally PS  block picture.  Il ike the lighting/shadow and the way it looks like he is waiting to come on the court.  If you also made this out of legos, personally, I am EXTREMEly impressed.', '2003-05-16 00:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(299796, 20996, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great idea and original.  I think the contrast could come up some .  Just a bit dull in the colors.  A touch more diffuse lighting may have boosted the color and made it a bit more vibrant.  Not that it matters on my scores, but I hate the border.</td>', 'Great idea and original.  I think the contrast could come up some .  Just a bit dull in the colors.  A touch more diffuse lighting may have boosted the color and made it a bit more vibrant.  Not that it matters on my scores, but I hate the border.', '2003-05-16 00:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(299800, 21130, 6771, '<td valign="top">Not that it is not a great idea, but it is pretty dull and boring.  Seems very flat color and contrast wise</td>', 'Not that it is not a great idea, but it is pretty dull and boring.  Seems very flat color and contrast wise', '2003-05-16 00:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(299804, 21086, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Focus looks good.  I think maybe taking the shot from lower angle and shooting up to have the white wall behind it and get the grey carpet out would have given more impact.  Doesn''t affect the score, but the border is hideous!</td>', 'Great concept. Focus looks good.  I think maybe taking the shot from lower angle and shooting up to have the white wall behind it and get the grey carpet out would have given more impact.  Doesn''t affect the score, but the border is hideous!', '2003-05-16 00:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(299812, 21144, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Bit on the dark side, even though it was to "erase" the glass and give the floating appearance.  one small area of background noise</td>', 'Great idea.  Bit on the dark side, even though it was to "erase" the glass and give the floating appearance.  one small area of background noise', '2003-05-16 00:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(299818, 21083, 6771, '<td valign="top">If you were looking to get something that looks totally made in an image editor, you did it.  Good job, but it is a tad boring.  Muted coloring for my taste</td>', 'If you were looking to get something that looks totally made in an image editor, you did it.  Good job, but it is a tad boring.  Muted coloring for my taste', '2003-05-16 00:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(299821, 21130, 7711, '<td valign="top">I see what you were trying to achieve here, but I just can''t say it worked. The cloulds look fake and totally digitized and over processed. Looks  more like a doppler than a photograph, but I applaud your idea and your creativity!</td>', 'I see what you were trying to achieve here, but I just can''t say it worked. The cloulds look fake and totally digitized and over processed. Looks  more like a doppler than a photograph, but I applaud your idea and your creativity!', '2003-05-16 00:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(299822, 21004, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup...your colors are oversaturated and the contrast is a little too high. There are dark shadows in the petals. You need to play with your light source to get a little more light on the flower, instead of using programs to adjust. Or maybe you used a flash/ They are too harsh on a closeup like this. I am only guessing that this might be the problem. The composition is good, the bckground color is good.</td>', 'Nice closeup...your colors are oversaturated and the contrast is a little too high. There are dark shadows in the petals. You need to play with your light source to get a little more light on the flower, instead of using programs to adjust. Or maybe you used a flash/ They are too harsh on a closeup like this. I am only guessing that this might be the problem. The composition is good, the bckground color is good.', '2003-05-16 00:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(299825, 21136, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot...how many tries did it take/ The colors are very good, except the black could have been richer. Lighting is good also.</td>', 'Nice action shot...how many tries did it take/ The colors are very good, except the black could have been richer. Lighting is good also.', '2003-05-16 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(299829, 21189, 2634, '<td valign="top">very original...nice shot. Background has a slight red tone to it, would like it to be a deeper black. Colors are a little noisy, probably couldn''t avoid it with the technique you used.</td>', 'very original...nice shot. Background has a slight red tone to it, would like it to be a deeper black. Colors are a little noisy, probably couldn''t avoid it with the technique you used.', '2003-05-16 00:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(299832, 21182, 2634, '<td valign="top">nice colors. The focus is a little too soft in my opinion. Would have liked to see a stem on the yellow one. The blue looks a little noisy, it could be a little oversaturated. i like the composition.</td>', 'nice colors. The focus is a little too soft in my opinion. Would have liked to see a stem on the yellow one. The blue looks a little noisy, it could be a little oversaturated. i like the composition.', '2003-05-16 00:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(299834, 21143, 2634, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, but the colors seem too fake. Are they oversaturated or overly adjusted? I''m not sure what it is, but the lighting also seems harsh causing them too look fake.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, but the colors seem too fake. Are they oversaturated or overly adjusted? I''m not sure what it is, but the lighting also seems harsh causing them too look fake.', '2003-05-16 00:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(299840, 20962, 7711, '<td valign="top">the flower pics are getting a bad rap, but I did one, and I love this one. The red is gorgeous, the blue balances and its nicely accented with the tiny bits of yellow. 10</td>', 'the flower pics are getting a bad rap, but I did one, and I love this one. The red is gorgeous, the blue balances and its nicely accented with the tiny bits of yellow. 10', '2003-05-16 01:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(299909, 21217, 6523, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo!</td>', 'Very interesting photo!', '2003-05-16 03:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(299934, 20996, 5728, '<td valign="top">Clever set-up, very creative. The result is good. If only the yellow tablets could have been the same color as the yellow on the bottles and the border this would have been a killer photo - 8.</td>', 'Clever set-up, very creative. The result is good. If only the yellow tablets could have been the same color as the yellow on the bottles and the border this would have been a killer photo - 8.', '2003-05-16 05:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(299936, 21089, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent color combinations, its very appealing to the eyes.</td>', 'Excellent color combinations, its very appealing to the eyes.', '2003-05-16 05:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(299938, 21004, 5728, '<td valign="top">The colors mix well together here. Did you bend the flower down and shoot from below it? The sky in the background has an amazing tone of blue to it, crispy!</td>', 'The colors mix well together here. Did you bend the flower down and shoot from below it? The sky in the background has an amazing tone of blue to it, crispy!', '2003-05-16 05:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(299940, 21085, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an original idea, I like it, good job - 8.</td>', 'This is an original idea, I like it, good job - 8.', '2003-05-16 05:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(299942, 20986, 3669, '<td valign="top">I must say...VERY NICE!!  I voted a 10 on this because this is a nice and unique representation of the primary colors.  The lighting is perfect and the colors literally pop out of the screen.  Only drawback...too bad there wasn''t a stand of red running through the yellow rope to even out the color trend.  You should score high...good luck!</td>', 'I must say...VERY NICE!!  I voted a 10 on this because this is a nice and unique representation of the primary colors.  The lighting is perfect and the colors literally pop out of the screen.  Only drawback...too bad there wasn''t a stand of red running through the yellow rope to even out the color trend.  You should score high...good luck!', '2003-05-16 05:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(299952, 21213, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Using the tennis balls was a neat way to portray the primary colors.  I like the watercolor background.   I think, however, it might be just a tad over-exposed.  The yellow balls seem a little washed out.  Perhaps just a little tone down in brightness would bring them out a little better without jeopardizing the richness of the other colors.  Also, I don''t especially like the multi-colored border.  I had experimented with the exact same thing on my photo and decided against it.  The simple black border would have been sufficient, in my opinion.  Good luck in the challenge!  8</td>', 'Nicely done!  Using the tennis balls was a neat way to portray the primary colors.  I like the watercolor background.   I think, however, it might be just a tad over-exposed.  The yellow balls seem a little washed out.  Perhaps just a little tone down in brightness would bring them out a little better without jeopardizing the richness of the other colors.  Also, I don''t especially like the multi-colored border.  I had experimented with the exact same thing on my photo and decided against it.  The simple black border would have been sufficient, in my opinion.  Good luck in the challenge!  8', '2003-05-16 05:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(299955, 21085, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot and an unique take on the challenge.  I also like how you coordinated the shirts to the color of the child''s hair.  I assume that this was done on purpose.  9  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very cute shot and an unique take on the challenge.  I also like how you coordinated the shirts to the color of the child''s hair.  I assume that this was done on purpose.  9  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-05-16 05:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(299956, 21099, 3669, '<td valign="top">Composed nicely.  Unique set-up for the challenge.  Lighting and clarity are perfect.  I like the reflection of red on the corkscrew.  It adds a nice touch.  Only drawback in my opinion...the border is just a little too wide for my liking.  It could do without most of the inside black portion.  9 - Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Composed nicely.  Unique set-up for the challenge.  Lighting and clarity are perfect.  I like the reflection of red on the corkscrew.  It adds a nice touch.  Only drawback in my opinion...the border is just a little too wide for my liking.  It could do without most of the inside black portion.  9 - Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-05-16 05:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(299959, 20950, 3669, '<td valign="top">I understand what you were trying to do with this by manipulating the colors or by using a filter to make the white stripes yellow.  Although you were successful in meeting the challenge, it turned the flag into a displeasing color and very unnatural.  I do like the ripples and shadows in it though.</td>', 'I understand what you were trying to do with this by manipulating the colors or by using a filter to make the white stripes yellow.  Although you were successful in meeting the challenge, it turned the flag into a displeasing color and very unnatural.  I do like the ripples and shadows in it though.', '2003-05-16 06:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(299960, 21084, 3669, '<td valign="top">Although this water droplet technique is getting a little over done, I do like your take of it by adding the yellow ribbon.  I do believe, however, that the droplets could have been in better focus to give it more of a "WOW" effect.</td>', 'Although this water droplet technique is getting a little over done, I do like your take of it by adding the yellow ribbon.  I do believe, however, that the droplets could have been in better focus to give it more of a "WOW" effect.', '2003-05-16 06:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(299962, 20998, 3669, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  I really like how you portrayed the primary colors for this challenge.  Turned out to be a cool effect.  The colors are vivid and literally pop out of the screen.   I can''t help but wonder, though, how it would look if the glasses had been placed on a mirrored tile so that the strips of color would have extended down through the whole picture.  I don''t particulairly like how the color abrubtly ends.  Since it wouldn''t be wise, in this case, to crop out the bottom of the glasses, there should be some way to extend the color down to your surface.  9  Good luck in the challenge</td>', 'This is really nice.  I really like how you portrayed the primary colors for this challenge.  Turned out to be a cool effect.  The colors are vivid and literally pop out of the screen.   I can''t help but wonder, though, how it would look if the glasses had been placed on a mirrored tile so that the strips of color would have extended down through the whole picture.  I don''t particulairly like how the color abrubtly ends.  Since it wouldn''t be wise, in this case, to crop out the bottom of the glasses, there should be some way to extend the color down to your surface.  9  Good luck in the challenge', '2003-05-16 06:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(299963, 21212, 3669, '<td valign="top">Oh, I bet this was messy!  I really like your take on the challenge by using the spilled jars of paint.  Although the blue is not represented as much as the yellow and red, the pattern it left is very effective.  I might have left the lids out of the picture.  They don''t really add anything positive to the photo.  The lighting seems a little uneven, but other than those two things, this is a very nice portrayal of the primary colors.  8 Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Oh, I bet this was messy!  I really like your take on the challenge by using the spilled jars of paint.  Although the blue is not represented as much as the yellow and red, the pattern it left is very effective.  I might have left the lids out of the picture.  They don''t really add anything positive to the photo.  The lighting seems a little uneven, but other than those two things, this is a very nice portrayal of the primary colors.  8 Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-05-16 06:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(299969, 21136, 5728, '<td valign="top">You only had one try at getting this one right huh? The idea is very good. The paint streams look like knitting needles somehow. Well done.</td>', 'You only had one try at getting this one right huh? The idea is very good. The paint streams look like knitting needles somehow. Well done.', '2003-05-16 07:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(299970, 21195, 5728, '<td valign="top">I wouild have rather seen this in portrait format. Other than that this is fantastic, those blues are awesome.</td>', 'I wouild have rather seen this in portrait format. Other than that this is fantastic, those blues are awesome.', '2003-05-16 07:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(299971, 21212, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is incredible! The textures and patterns are so defined. A good idea, well shot - Gary</td>', 'This is incredible! The textures and patterns are so defined. A good idea, well shot - Gary', '2003-05-16 07:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(299972, 20986, 5728, '<td valign="top">Clear, focused and colorful. A top photo for sure.</td>', 'Clear, focused and colorful. A top photo for sure.', '2003-05-16 07:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
