(301176, 20996, 811, '<td valign="top">Tylenol, definitely.  :-)<br/> <br/>Amend --  Great work on the composition.  It has a strong, stable feeling to it.  Two minor nitpicks.  I think a tighter crop, even one that had the subjects "spilling" out of the frame would have been effective, and the border bothers me.  Doesn''t affect your "score" but I do think in this case it effects the overall effect of the picture.  I find myself drawn to the yellow line instead fo the bottles.</td>', 'Tylenol, definitely.  :-) Amend --  Great work on the composition.  It has a strong, stable feeling to it.  Two minor nitpicks.  I think a tighter crop, even one that had the subjects "spilling" out of the frame would have been effective, and the border bothers me.  Doesn''t affect your "score" but I do think in this case it effects the overall effect of the picture.  I find myself drawn to the yellow line instead fo the bottles.', '2003-05-18 00:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
