(301181, 21069, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here, and the strong vertical "motion"  However, at the risk of sounding nitpicky, I do think it would have been more effective (for this challenge, anyway) to include only the primary colors adn not a wide spectrum.  But that''s probably just me.</td>', 'I like the colors here, and the strong vertical "motion"  However, at the risk of sounding nitpicky, I do think it would have been more effective (for this challenge, anyway) to include only the primary colors adn not a wide spectrum.  But that''s probably just me.', '2003-05-18 00:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
