(301463, 21101, 5728, '<td valign="top">I will never get tired of seeing tulips. These are beautiful!</td>', 'I will never get tired of seeing tulips. These are beautiful!', '2003-05-18 18:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(301464, 21205, 5728, '<td valign="top">What a good idea! Creative, and it turned out well too! just a bit of glare on some of the paper clips but otherwise a good entry!</td>', 'What a good idea! Creative, and it turned out well too! just a bit of glare on some of the paper clips but otherwise a good entry!', '2003-05-18 18:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(301465, 21121, 5728, '<td valign="top">You have a good eye! Love the perspective.</td>', 'You have a good eye! Love the perspective.', '2003-05-18 18:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(301468, 20950, 1202, '<td valign="top">this is just too much for me.   digital defacing of my flag.  3</td>', 'this is just too much for me.   digital defacing of my flag.  3', '2003-05-18 18:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(301489, 20998, 2223, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, my fave this challenge. How did you not get any glare??</td>', 'This is beautiful, my fave this challenge. How did you not get any glare??', '2003-05-18 20:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(301491, 21223, 4267, '<td valign="top">you forgot the red. :o(</td>', 'you forgot the red. :o(', '2003-05-18 20:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(301493, 21108, 4267, '<td valign="top">seems over exposed</td>', 'seems over exposed', '2003-05-18 20:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(301539, 20998, 843, '<td valign="top">Excellent execution, although the idea is a bit played.</td>', 'Excellent execution, although the idea is a bit played.', '2003-05-18 21:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(301655, 20952, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately fits the challenge, however, not a real thrilling photo.  Quite cluttered, and the colors don''t seem to jump out as much as I feel they should.  They seem dark or muted by maybe the lighting conditions?  Focus seems good, and technically it''s an ok shot, just not ''jump out of my seat'' exciting. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately fits the challenge, however, not a real thrilling photo.  Quite cluttered, and the colors don''t seem to jump out as much as I feel they should.  They seem dark or muted by maybe the lighting conditions?  Focus seems good, and technically it''s an ok shot, just not ''jump out of my seat'' exciting. ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(301657, 21052, 3080, '<td valign="top">The angle and framing/cropping are really good. I like how you have put the flower to the left of the photo.  That makes for something nice to look at.  The blue grass kind of freaks me out.  Otherwise, it''s a good shot.  Focus and clarity are good, and the color really jumps out of the photo.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The angle and framing/cropping are really good. I like how you have put the flower to the left of the photo.  That makes for something nice to look at.  The blue grass kind of freaks me out.  Otherwise, it''s a good shot.  Focus and clarity are good, and the color really jumps out of the photo.  ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(301660, 21174, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I really like it a lot.  It''s first of all the simplicity of the composition that appeals to me.  The primary colors are nicely exposed here too.   <br/>Good luck in the challenge and all your photographic endeavors.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I really like it a lot.  It''s first of all the simplicity of the composition that appeals to me.  The primary colors are nicely exposed here too.   Good luck in the challenge and all your photographic endeavors.', '2003-05-18 23:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(301661, 21085, 7711, '<td valign="top">I love the candid "childhood" feel to this. The colours are strong, and despite it being the backs of these girls, its still got a lot of emotion and happiness to it. 9</td>', 'I love the candid "childhood" feel to this. The colours are strong, and despite it being the backs of these girls, its still got a lot of emotion and happiness to it. 9', '2003-05-18 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(301662, 21089, 3080, '<td valign="top">I am assuming that these are cut out butterflies or something.  Would be interested in knowing how this was done.  The color is beautiful.  Really stands out nicely on the green background.  Focus and clarity are good, and I like how you have this setup.  Nice job. ~Heather~</td>', 'I am assuming that these are cut out butterflies or something.  Would be interested in knowing how this was done.  The color is beautiful.  Really stands out nicely on the green background.  Focus and clarity are good, and I like how you have this setup.  Nice job. ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(301663, 21205, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like your composition with the colors radiating into the picture from the corner.  I also like that there is an order to the coloring.  It''s a very nice image.  Dof is good, exposure is good too.   You left a comfortable amount of negative space.  It all works well together.  Nice job!</td>', 'I like your composition with the colors radiating into the picture from the corner.  I also like that there is an order to the coloring.  It''s a very nice image.  Dof is good, exposure is good too.   You left a comfortable amount of negative space.  It all works well together.  Nice job!', '2003-05-18 23:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(301664, 21206, 7711, '<td valign="top">terribly out of focus, and compostionally its titled and strange. It seems to lack any sort of a message or elegance. Perhaps just the box of stress balls lit from off camera by the candle would have been stronger? I''m afraid I could not rate this very high.</td>', 'terribly out of focus, and compostionally its titled and strange. It seems to lack any sort of a message or elegance. Perhaps just the box of stress balls lit from off camera by the candle would have been stronger? I''m afraid I could not rate this very high.', '2003-05-18 23:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(301667, 21024, 1280, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what a shooter is, but the colors here are nice and primary with interest.</td>', 'I have no idea what a shooter is, but the colors here are nice and primary with interest.', '2003-05-18 23:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(301668, 20671, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is really cute.  I think that the lighting is a bit harsh on these adorable little children.  They have glares on their faces, and clothing.  I think the lighting is throwing the focus off slightly, but it is still a really cute shot.  I do like the angle and framing/cropping you chose.</td>', 'This is really cute.  I think that the lighting is a bit harsh on these adorable little children.  They have glares on their faces, and clothing.  I think the lighting is throwing the focus off slightly, but it is still a really cute shot.  I do like the angle and framing/cropping you chose.', '2003-05-18 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(301673, 20947, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Prolly someone''s Mommy or Daddy...tehehehe.  Nicely captured in every way.  Good job!</td>', 'Nicely done!  Prolly someone''s Mommy or Daddy...tehehehe.  Nicely captured in every way.  Good job!', '2003-05-18 23:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(301675, 21133, 3080, '<td valign="top">I guess I read the challenge to say primary colors, which are red, yellow and blue.  I see pink, green and yellow here.  I guess you could count the yellow, however, it''s not really a main part of the shot at all.  Please don''t get me wrong.  This is an excellent shot.  I think you did a really great job capturing it.  The background is blurred nicely and does not take away from the shot.  ~Heather~</td>', 'I guess I read the challenge to say primary colors, which are red, yellow and blue.  I see pink, green and yellow here.  I guess you could count the yellow, however, it''s not really a main part of the shot at all.  Please don''t get me wrong.  This is an excellent shot.  I think you did a really great job capturing it.  The background is blurred nicely and does not take away from the shot.  ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(301677, 21103, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks cool.  I really like the round balls against the straight boards.  The strong diagonals are really neat.  Colors are great.  I love the angle and framing/cropping.  The focus and clarity are good as well.  Nothing really to complain about here, just a really neat shot.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Looks cool.  I really like the round balls against the straight boards.  The strong diagonals are really neat.  Colors are great.  I love the angle and framing/cropping.  The focus and clarity are good as well.  Nothing really to complain about here, just a really neat shot.  ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(301679, 20890, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good job here. The colors meet the challenge as with many other images in the challenge.  What really makes this stand is the priceless expression on that sweet face.   It''s composed beautifully too.  Definetely one of my top favorites.  10</td>', 'Very good job here. The colors meet the challenge as with many other images in the challenge.  What really makes this stand is the priceless expression on that sweet face.   It''s composed beautifully too.  Definetely one of my top favorites.  10', '2003-05-18 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(301680, 20851, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better if the red were more RED, and less pink.  The angle is a little off, I know a lot of people don''t like symetry, but I wish this were a bit more centered and straight on.  The glare in the red area is a distraction in my opinion. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think this would be better if the red were more RED, and less pink.  The angle is a little off, I know a lot of people don''t like symetry, but I wish this were a bit more centered and straight on.  The glare in the red area is a distraction in my opinion. ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(301681, 21212, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I like how you have balanced it by putting the red top on the bottom near the yellow, and the yellow top near the red at the top of the photo.  I think my favorite part is where the blue goes down into a point into the yellow near the bottom of the photo.  The focus and clarity appears to be really nice, and the angle and framing/cropping are nice as well.  Good shot! ~Heather~</td>', 'This is very nice.  I like how you have balanced it by putting the red top on the bottom near the yellow, and the yellow top near the red at the top of the photo.  I think my favorite part is where the blue goes down into a point into the yellow near the bottom of the photo.  The focus and clarity appears to be really nice, and the angle and framing/cropping are nice as well.  Good shot! ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(301683, 21086, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is cute, and definately fits the challenge.  I think the border is a little overkill though.  Focus, and lighting appear to be good.  I do wish though that there could have been a bit more lighting under the chair as to not mute the colors of the blocks under the chair.  Otherwise, a nice job! ~Heather~</td>', 'This is cute, and definately fits the challenge.  I think the border is a little overkill though.  Focus, and lighting appear to be good.  I do wish though that there could have been a bit more lighting under the chair as to not mute the colors of the blocks under the chair.  Otherwise, a nice job! ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(301684, 21181, 1280, '<td valign="top">The backlighting does so much to enhance this perfect yellow rose.  I love everything about this composition.  Squisito! 10</td>', 'The backlighting does so much to enhance this perfect yellow rose.  I love everything about this composition.  Squisito! 10', '2003-05-18 23:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(301686, 21149, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is cute, but the shadow bothers me.  The shadow of the flowers isn''t so bad, but the shadow of the rope is a little much.  The colors are really nice and really jump out of the shot.  focus and clarity are really good as well.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This is cute, but the shadow bothers me.  The shadow of the flowers isn''t so bad, but the shadow of the rope is a little much.  The colors are really nice and really jump out of the shot.  focus and clarity are really good as well.  ~Heather~', '2003-05-18 23:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(301696, 21181, 2560, '<td valign="top">I think your light, the sun maybe, might have been a hair bright.  still a great photo.</td>', 'I think your light, the sun maybe, might have been a hair bright.  still a great photo.', '2003-05-19 00:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(301697, 20998, 7706, '<td valign="top">That is so cool, how on earth do you do that?</td>', 'That is so cool, how on earth do you do that?', '2003-05-19 00:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(301698, 21098, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed!  Simple composition, good use of color, and abstract enough to make it almost mysterious.  I like it. Reminds me a bit of a bird in flight.</td>', 'Very nice indeed!  Simple composition, good use of color, and abstract enough to make it almost mysterious.  I like it. Reminds me a bit of a bird in flight.', '2003-05-19 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(301700, 21213, 7706, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up, and I like your border. The only thing I would have done different with I was you, would be to fix the tennis balls, so that the white bit is less random, either in a patter or all facing same direction, but thats just me. I am anal like that. (but probably would be hard to set up or would take 2 hours).</td>', 'Very nice set up, and I like your border. The only thing I would have done different with I was you, would be to fix the tennis balls, so that the white bit is less random, either in a patter or all facing same direction, but thats just me. I am anal like that. (but probably would be hard to set up or would take 2 hours).', '2003-05-19 00:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(301701, 21130, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Would make wonderful wall paper or fabric.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Would make wonderful wall paper or fabric.', '2003-05-19 00:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(301702, 21085, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like this photo its different. I don''t know where you are from, but I think its fiting that you used such young kids. I know kids that age here are in ''primary school'', so I think it fits :)</td>', 'I like this photo its different. I don''t know where you are from, but I think its fiting that you used such young kids. I know kids that age here are in ''primary school'', so I think it fits :)', '2003-05-19 00:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(301703, 21220, 2560, '<td valign="top">you have a little bit of light on the background and the blue needs a bit of light.  good photo</td>', 'you have a little bit of light on the background and the blue needs a bit of light.  good photo', '2003-05-19 00:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(301704, 21142, 7706, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but they seem a tad out of focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but they seem a tad out of focus.', '2003-05-19 00:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(301706, 21089, 7706, '<td valign="top">Are they real? This a great photo, colors are so amazing.</td>', 'Are they real? This a great photo, colors are so amazing.', '2003-05-19 00:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(301707, 21194, 2560, '<td valign="top">doesn''t appear to be sharp.</td>', 'doesn''t appear to be sharp.', '2003-05-19 00:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(301709, 21004, 1280, '<td valign="top">Ooooooowie!  This is gorgeous!  Contrast and color and comp are all so good. Inspiring work!</td>', 'Ooooooowie!  This is gorgeous!  Contrast and color and comp are all so good. Inspiring work!', '2003-05-19 00:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(301710, 21209, 7706, '<td valign="top">Simple but cool. Great idea :)</td>', 'Simple but cool. Great idea :)', '2003-05-19 00:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(301711, 21200, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like it, but is there any way to limit the reflection? Maybe by changing the angle of the lighting.</td>', 'I like it, but is there any way to limit the reflection? Maybe by changing the angle of the lighting.', '2003-05-19 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(301713, 21108, 2560, '<td valign="top">Its Blurry!!   I bet you haven''t heard that yet...  It seems to have a hot spot or two otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'Its Blurry!!   I bet you haven''t heard that yet...  It seems to have a hot spot or two otherwise a great shot.', '2003-05-19 00:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(301714, 21203, 7706, '<td valign="top">Great colors I do like that its not center, but at the same time, I wish there was a little less open space. Its a nice photo though :)</td>', 'Great colors I do like that its not center, but at the same time, I wish there was a little less open space. Its a nice photo though :)', '2003-05-19 00:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(301715, 21085, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  I like the "natural" look to it.  Great use of the  primary colors!</td>', 'Awesome shot.  I like the "natural" look to it.  Great use of the  primary colors!', '2003-05-19 00:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(301716, 20997, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and vividness of this.  I normally don''t care for abstracts, but this one appeals to me.</td>', 'I really like the composition and vividness of this.  I normally don''t care for abstracts, but this one appeals to me.', '2003-05-19 00:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(301717, 21213, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the background really provides a nice contrast on this one.  My only nitpicky comment would be to position them so that the lines on the balls actually lead the eyes in a particular direction.</td>', 'I think the background really provides a nice contrast on this one.  My only nitpicky comment would be to position them so that the lines on the balls actually lead the eyes in a particular direction.', '2003-05-19 00:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(301719, 21200, 1280, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea; well executed.</td>', 'Excellent idea; well executed.', '2003-05-19 00:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(301722, 21089, 811, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are so surreal it is awesome.  And i love the pattern the grass makes!</td>', 'The colors in this are so surreal it is awesome.  And i love the pattern the grass makes!', '2003-05-19 00:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(301723, 20671, 4267, '<td valign="top">needs more blue other than the kids collar... red and yellow completely dominate</td>', 'needs more blue other than the kids collar... red and yellow completely dominate', '2003-05-19 00:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(301724, 21103, 811, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit bright in spots, but overall this is an excellent picture.  I really like the diagonal composition.</td>', 'The light is a bit bright in spots, but overall this is an excellent picture.  I really like the diagonal composition.', '2003-05-19 00:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(301725, 20948, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this one.  I do think the focus could be a touch stronger though.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this one.  I do think the focus could be a touch stronger though.', '2003-05-19 00:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(301727, 20998, 4267, '<td valign="top">not again!</td>', 'not again!', '2003-05-19 00:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(301728, 20870, 4267, '<td valign="top">looks like it is missing blue and red...</td>', 'looks like it is missing blue and red...', '2003-05-19 00:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(301729, 21189, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is soooooooooo good!  Really good!  10</td>', 'This is soooooooooo good!  Really good!  10', '2003-05-19 00:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(301731, 21106, 4267, '<td valign="top">wheres the blue?</td>', 'wheres the blue?', '2003-05-19 00:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(301732, 21196, 811, '<td valign="top">This is a great action shot, but I think it would have been more effective if you could have changed your position so that there was more of the girls, and less of the building.</td>', 'This is a great action shot, but I think it would have been more effective if you could have changed your position so that there was more of the girls, and less of the building.', '2003-05-19 00:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(301733, 20719, 1280, '<td valign="top">Creative idea!</td>', 'Creative idea!', '2003-05-19 00:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(301734, 20950, 811, '<td valign="top">Compositionally fine, but I don''t think I find the yellow particularly effective.</td>', 'Compositionally fine, but I don''t think I find the yellow particularly effective.', '2003-05-19 00:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(301735, 21084, 4267, '<td valign="top">great photo but this techique has been over killed</td>', 'great photo but this techique has been over killed', '2003-05-19 00:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(301736, 20893, 811, '<td valign="top">The colors seem a bit flat to me.  Were you using a flash?  I think this could have been made stronger by placing it on a different background.  Maybe a solid black or solid white.  The would grain takes away from the color, I think, by adding another none primary/none secondary color.</td>', 'The colors seem a bit flat to me.  Were you using a flash?  I think this could have been made stronger by placing it on a different background.  Maybe a solid black or solid white.  The would grain takes away from the color, I think, by adding another none primary/none secondary color.', '2003-05-19 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(301737, 20626, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great job.....beautiful art!</td>', 'Great job.....beautiful art!', '2003-05-19 00:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(301738, 21127, 811, '<td valign="top">Great brilliant colors, but depth wise a little flat, I think.</td>', 'Great brilliant colors, but depth wise a little flat, I think.', '2003-05-19 00:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(301739, 21086, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the composition of this shot, but I think if you could have placed a solid color (white or black perhaps) under the chair and toys,  it would have been more effective.  The color of the carpet seems to take away from the strength of the primaries.  Also, on a side note, and not related to your score at all, the broad yellow band in your border really pulls the eyes out of the picture.  Maybe if the red and yellow were reversed.</td>', 'I love the composition of this shot, but I think if you could have placed a solid color (white or black perhaps) under the chair and toys,  it would have been more effective.  The color of the carpet seems to take away from the strength of the primaries.  Also, on a side note, and not related to your score at all, the broad yellow band in your border really pulls the eyes out of the picture.  Maybe if the red and yellow were reversed.', '2003-05-19 00:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(301740, 21089, 1280, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful job !  Surreal and artsie.  Nice comp and lighting   A wonderful fantasy.</td>', 'What a beautiful job !  Surreal and artsie.  Nice comp and lighting   A wonderful fantasy.', '2003-05-19 00:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(301741, 21115, 4267, '<td valign="top">a blue pepper? did you change the color?</td>', 'a blue pepper? did you change the color?', '2003-05-19 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(301742, 21121, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice, interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice, interesting shot.', '2003-05-19 00:51:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(301743, 21219, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is so cute.  What a precious child and with a dandy....so nice. Good picture.</td>', 'This is so cute.  What a precious child and with a dandy....so nice. Good picture.', '2003-05-19 00:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(301744, 21143, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow...this has a lot going for it....different.</td>', 'Wow...this has a lot going for it....different.', '2003-05-19 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(301748, 21213, 7706, '<td valign="top">Congrats. 15th place is pretty good :-D</td>', 'Congrats. 15th place is pretty good :-D', '2003-05-19 01:01:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(301749, 20998, 6900, '<td valign="top">Far and away the best shot of the challenge - Kiwi and I guessed it was you just because the score you said you had.  Congrats again Jack.<br/> <br/>(Note: to the person who gave this a 1, check your prescription on those glasses and/or quit being a lame.)<br/> <br/>M<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-19 00:48:17.</i></td>', 'Far and away the best shot of the challenge - Kiwi and I guessed it was you just because the score you said you had.  Congrats again Jack. (Note: to the person who gave this a 1, check your prescription on those glasses and/or quit being a lame.) M', '2003-05-19 01:02:09.000000', '2003-05-19 01:48:17.000000', 0),
(301750, 21089, 6900, '<td valign="top">Excellent work as always, David.  I''d rather them against the leaves than flying - not real?</td>', 'Excellent work as always, David.  I''d rather them against the leaves than flying - not real?', '2003-05-19 01:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(301752, 21213, 70, '<td valign="top">You''re movin'' up, Mav!</td>', 'You''re movin'' up, Mav!', '2003-05-19 01:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(301753, 20998, 327, '<td valign="top">Your on a roll! Way to go! Very nice.</td>', 'Your on a roll! Way to go! Very nice.', '2003-05-19 01:05:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(301754, 21213, 6900, '<td valign="top">Thanks Loz!  Thanks MK!  Thanks frisca.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-19 00:17:43.</i></td>', 'Thanks Loz!  Thanks MK!  Thanks frisca.', '2003-05-19 01:06:58.000000', '2003-05-19 01:17:43.000000', 0),
(301755, 20998, 3599, '<td valign="top">My number 1 pick for the week.  Congratulations on this one!</td>', 'My number 1 pick for the week.  Congratulations on this one!', '2003-05-19 01:07:08.000000', NULL, 0),
