(301804, 21085, 6870, '<td valign="top">This photo should have won first place, pure and simple. No offense to the other photos at the top, but this is well nigh the "perfect" shot. Clear colors, emotion, excellent composition and great cropping--simply wonderful. With more photos like this, you''ll get your ribbon yet!</td>', 'This photo should have won first place, pure and simple. No offense to the other photos at the top, but this is well nigh the "perfect" shot. Clear colors, emotion, excellent composition and great cropping--simply wonderful. With more photos like this, you''ll get your ribbon yet!', '2003-05-19 01:47:39.000000', NULL, 0),
