(301822, 21143, 1031, '<td valign="top">I also came across some <a href="//www.pbase.com/image/15681446" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Blue Roses</a> a couple of weeks ago, but was too chicken to submit to the Flora challenge. The ones I saw have crystals on the edges of the petals as if they''d used a sugar solution to dye them...your''s look a little blown-out on the edges of the blue petals -- maybe a light diffuser would help there (my flower photo has a similar problem...sigh).</td>', 'I also came across some Blue Roses a couple of weeks ago, but was too chicken to submit to the Flora challenge. The ones I saw have crystals on the edges of the petals as if they''d used a sugar solution to dye them...your''s look a little blown-out on the edges of the blue petals -- maybe a light diffuser would help there (my flower photo has a similar problem...sigh).', '2003-05-19 02:15:01.000000', NULL, 0),
