(301824, 21089, 714, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  This was my favorite.  I love the colors and the fact that they are real.  Wow!!  Congrats!<br/> <br/>oops, I guess if I read the comments I would see that they are fake. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-05-19 01:27:19.</i></td>', 'I really like this shot.  This was my favorite.  I love the colors and the fact that they are real.  Wow!!  Congrats! oops, I guess if I read the comments I would see that they are fake. ', '2003-05-19 02:24:03.000000', '2003-05-19 02:27:19.000000', 0),
