(301868, 21213, 6900, '<td valign="top">David - the problem is *I* never know what I''m going to do next!  :)<br/> <br/>I have a particular style - a play with lighting that I like.  But unfortunately I''ve seen that with my transportation and my Black Magic entries that I''m better off trying to learn this very bright direct or close-up lighting.<br/> <br/>As far as the pillowcase - that''s funny!  I have seen some good backgrounds so I thought I''d try it. Tried to throw it out of focus, but with digital....ya know?  f2.8 is about as good as it gets.<br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'David - the problem is *I* never know what I''m going to do next!  :) I have a particular style - a play with lighting that I like.  But unfortunately I''ve seen that with my transportation and my Black Magic entries that I''m better off trying to learn this very bright direct or close-up lighting. As far as the pillowcase - that''s funny!  I have seen some good backgrounds so I thought I''d try it. Tried to throw it out of focus, but with digital....ya know?  f2.8 is about as good as it gets. Thanks again!', '2003-05-19 06:57:15.000000', NULL, 0),
