(996532, 21215, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is great example of how a challenge can push you.  you finished well with a nice challenge entry.  the question is, what to do next.  i think this is a shot that would sell (meaning that somebody else might like to put it on their wall), if it was reshot without the moon and a little more dead-on.  it might also be interesting to look at this from a slightly lower angle, adding 20-30% more negative space at the top...just a suggestion.  as far as challenges go, i can''t say anything else but good job!</td>', 'this is great example of how a challenge can push you.  you finished well with a nice challenge entry.  the question is, what to do next.  i think this is a shot that would sell (meaning that somebody else might like to put it on their wall), if it was reshot without the moon and a little more dead-on.  it might also be interesting to look at this from a slightly lower angle, adding 20-30% more negative space at the top...just a suggestion.  as far as challenges go, i can''t say anything else but good job!', '2004-11-07 08:41:25.000000', NULL, 0),
