(2436904, 21143, 56561, '<td valign="top">This picture is full of life - full of Summer. It''s Beautiful.  I tend to focus in on the Yellow Rose ,,, but I keep moving my eyes towards the Blue Rose. I can see the "veins" in the petals of the Blue Rose whereas the Yellow and Red Roses are without "veins".  <br/> <br/>If there is a story here would it be that the Blue Rose is struggling to become as "perfect" as the other Roses ?? <br/> <br/>I love the picture though.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This picture is full of life - full of Summer. It''s Beautiful.  I tend to focus in on the Yellow Rose ,,, but I keep moving my eyes towards the Blue Rose. I can see the "veins" in the petals of the Blue Rose whereas the Yellow and Red Roses are without "veins".   If there is a story here would it be that the Blue Rose is struggling to become as "perfect" as the other Roses ??  I love the picture though. ', '2006-05-19 16:50:58.000000', NULL, 0),
